  unitName: Oni Kageri
  unitId: 61073
  unitNumber: 1544
  description: A malicious specter that haunts the world of Ohbanahara. Stories tell
    us that she once lost a battle with a monstrous beast that attempted to devour
    children, and that we now see her form corrupted by evil energies. Not only have
    her appearance and nature changed considerably, but she also retains little of
    her original personality, causing her to attack any humans she sees now. Even
    so, witness accounts tell us that she has never attempted to harm a child under
    any circumstances.
  summonDesc: Urgh... I'm sorry.<br>I couldn't keep you safe.<br>All I wanted was
    to play!
  fusionDesc: Power...give me more power.<br>I'll save them next time.<br>I need
    power to destroy everything there is!
  evoDesc: The time for fun is over.<br>Everyone, run away.<br>You'll be sucked in
    by the power. I wish I could have played more...
  element: 6
  rarity: 3
